OL,3,GNEWSABlue Lights and Celebrity Traitors
OL,4,Amost watched BBC programmes in NI      
OL,6,FThe police drama Blue Lights and The   
OL,7,FCelebrity Traitors were the most       
OL,8,Fwatched BBC programmes in Northern     
OL,9,FIreland in 2025/2026.                  
OL,11,FThat is according to the communications
OL,12,Fregulator Ofcom.                       
OL,14,FCoverage of the North West 200 races,  
OL,15,FGAA, Irish league football and the     
OL,16,Fdocumentary Kinahan: The True Story of 
OL,17,FIreland's Mafia were also among the top
OL,18,Fprogrammes on the BBC iPlayer.         
OL,20,FMore widely, almost four-in-five adults
OL,21,F(78%) in Northern Ireland used the BBC 
OL,22,Fat least once a week.                  
